  The reel_script says the saplings are 'வைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளன' and that the planting will happen during the season, but the article says planting is in the northeast monsoon season — this is consistent; however the reel_script says the 38 panchayats are where the saplings are planted/ready, which the article does not state: the article says the 38 panchayats have funds allocated under NREGS for tree-growing work, not that the saplings are for those panchayats specifically
  The slides_spec line 'உடுமலை ஒன்றியத்தின் கிராமங்களுக்காக' and the headline 'உடுமலையில் பழமரக்கன்றுகள் தயார்' / '38 ஊராட்சிகளில் நடவு' imply the saplings will be planted in all 38 panchayats, which the article does not say
  The slides_spec line '38 ஊராட்சிகளில் மரம் வளர்ப்புக்கு நிதி ஒதுக்கீடு' is under the title 'யார் பராமரிப்பு?' and the headline 'உடுமலை கிராமங்களில்' generalizes the location; the article says the saplings are at Podipatti government nursery, while the headline and slides omit that the saplings are in the Podipatti nursery in the headline (minor), and the caption says the saplings are at the nursery but the reel_script claims the saplings are placed in the nursery as ready for villages of the whole Udumalai union, a broader scope than the article
